@title Parts import from the palette: the table importer, and no old error over it
@area Parts
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Round 21: "import parts from a table" opens the table importer (not the folder one), and an error toast from an earlier try is gone when the dialog opens.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/parts/price-list-de.csv
click_text File
wait 4
click_text "Import parts"
wait 4
click_text "Import parts from a folder"
wait 10
shot old-error
key ctrl+k
text "import parts from a table"
wait 5
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/parts/price-list-de.csv
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Import parts from price-list-de.csv"
shot dialog-over-no-toast
check_layout
